        {
            "id": 2,
            "component": "ArticleText",
            "locales": {
                "en": {"title": "{{A little bit}} about me..."},
                "es": {"title": "{{Un poco}} sobre mí..."}
            },
            "settings": {
                "order_items_by": "id",
                "order_items_sort": "asc"
            },
            "items": [
                {
                    "id": 1,
                    "img": "images/pictures/about-texts-image-1.png",
                    "faIcon": "",
                    "faIconColors": {"bg": "", "fill": ""},
                    "locales": {
                        "en": {
                            "text": "<p>Give me a computer and I'll change your world.</p><p>I am a {{Computer Technician}} with [[more than 3 years]] of experience, specialized in frontend development and experienced in production environments and system support.</p><p>This professional path has allowed me to adapt to different environments and needs. I consider myself a technical profile with a creative mindset, capable of providing efficient and functional solutions. I am oriented towards collaboration in projects where technology and creativity.</p><p>I look forward to collaborating [[with you!]]</p>"
                        },
                        "es": {
                            "text":"<p>Si tengo un ordenador, te cambio el mundo.</p><p>Soy {{Técnico Informático}} con [[más de 3 años]] de experiencia, especializado en desarrollo frontend y con experiencia en entornos de producción y soporte de sistemas.</p><p>Este recorrido profesional me ha permitido adaptarme a diferentes entornos y necesidades. Me considero un perfil técnico con una mentalidad creativa, capaz de aportar soluciones eficientes y funcionales. Estoy orientado a la colaboración en proyectos donde la tecnología y la creatividad.</p><p>¡Espero con interés colaborar [[contigo!]]</p>"
                        }
                    }
                }
            ]
        },

